+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Cart resilience
+
+- [x] 1.1 Normalize persisted cart lines whose product is deleted or unavailable, remove stale lines safely, and make cart reads return empty/filtered carts with recalculated quantity, subtotal, total, and totals; verify with service/populator tests for mixed and product-only carts.
+- [x] 1.2 Apply the same stale-line invariant to cart PUT, multi-add, and checkout flows, and preserve 404 behavior when adding a deleted SKU; verify with cart API integration tests including successful checkout without the deleted item.
+
+## 2. Historical order resilience
+
+- [x] 2.1 Make order product response mapping use persisted order-line SKU, name, quantity, price, and subtotal when the catalog product is missing, while treating live enrichment as optional; verify unit tests for deleted-product order lines.
+- [x] 2.2 Verify merchant detail/list, customer detail/list, and order-status update paths with an order whose product is deleted, including unchanged totals and captured line values.
+
+## 3. Product access and regression coverage
+
+- [x] 3.1 Ensure v2 SKU lookup returns HTTP 404 for deleted products and active products remain unaffected; verify with controller/API tests.
+- [x] 3.2 Run the focused cart/order/product test suites and a Maven compilation/package check, fixing regressions until all requested endpoint scenarios pass.
+
+## Workflow follow-up
+
+- Archive the completed OpenSpec change after implementation and verification.
